Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.44,0:01:50.21,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Even if they don't match your ideals,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.23,0:01:51.96,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}chase your ambitions in your own way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.98,0:01:53.79,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Even if they don't match your ideals,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.82,0:01:55.65,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}chase your ambitions in your own way
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.28,0:02:10.14,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}なりたい自分を がむしゃらに追いかけて
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.17,0:02:15.88,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}気がつけば大人になっていた
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.30,0:02:20.94,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}人は誰も思い通り 努力すれば夢叶うって
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.97,0:02:22.78,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}そんな甘くはないストーリー
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.80,0:02:24.86,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}必死こいて上目指しても
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.89,0:02:26.99,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}結果こそ全て 分かってる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.02,0:02:28.12,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}解かってない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.14,0:02:29.87,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}いつかきっと誰か見てる信じ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.89,0:02:32.16,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}今日も歩き続ける
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.19,0:02:34.96,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}諦めそう挫けそう
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.98,0:02:37.19,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}から見える景色
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.15,0:02:44.74,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}絶望と苦しみの暗闇のその先
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.62,0:02:50.10,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}果てなき道の先で待つモノ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.12,0:02:53.85,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}遠くてもこの手で掴み取るため
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.88,0:02:57.44,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}理想とは違う夢のカタチ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.46,0:02:59.11,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}追い続けもがきながら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.13,0:03:01.53,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}前に進むだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.55,0:03:03.32,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}今この手にする
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.34,0:03:05.07,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}We change the game from our own side
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.10,0:03:08.70,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}まだ見ぬ世界を自由に生きてく
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.72,0:03:10.49,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Even if they don't match your ideals,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.52,0:03:12.20,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}chase your ambitions in your own way
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.23,0:03:14.08,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Even if they don't match your ideals,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.10,0:03:16.15,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}chase your ambitions in your own way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.44,0:01:50.21,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}即便与理想中的模样大相径庭
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.23,0:01:51.96,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}也要以自己的方式追逐心中所向
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.98,0:01:53.79,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}即便与理想中的模样大相径庭
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.82,0:01:55.65,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}也要以自己的方式追逐心中所向
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.28,0:02:10.14,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}不顾一切追寻理想的自我 蓦然回首已褪去年少青涩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.17,0:02:15.88,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}恍然发觉早已成长为大人模样
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.30,0:02:20.94,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}人们总说只要努力付出 就能让美梦成真得偿所愿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.97,0:02:22.78,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}可现实哪有这般天真浪漫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.80,0:02:24.86,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}哪怕拼尽全力向上攀登
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.89,0:02:26.99,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}最终结果才是一切 虽然明白
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.02,0:02:28.12,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}却又难以释怀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.14,0:02:29.87,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}坚信终有一天会被人所见证
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.89,0:02:32.16,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}今天也继续迈步向前
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.19,0:02:34.96,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}在想要放弃想要认输时
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.98,0:02:37.19,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}看见的风景
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.15,0:02:44.74,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}绝望与苦痛交织的黑暗尽头
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.62,0:02:50.10,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}在道路终点等待着的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.12,0:02:53.85,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}哪怕遥远也要亲手将其紧握
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.88,0:02:57.44,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}与理想背道而驰的梦想形态
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.46,0:02:59.11,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}继续追寻即使遍体鳞伤
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.13,0:03:01.53,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}也要坚定前行不止
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.55,0:03:03.32,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}此刻紧握在手中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.34,0:03:05.07,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}我们要从己方彻底改写规则
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.10,0:03:08.70,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}在尚未知晓的世界自由生存
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.72,0:03:10.49,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}即便与理想中的模样大相径庭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.52,0:03:12.20,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}也要以自己的方式追逐心中所向
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.23,0:03:14.08,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}即便与理想中的模样大相径庭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.10,0:03:16.15,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}也要以自己的方式追逐心中所向
